/T (13. Design Rationale . > The MealMate landing page was designed with a clean and health-focused visual style to communicate the purpose of the application quickly. Green was chosen as the primary color to represent health, freshness, and natural food. The hero section provides a clear introduction and prominent call-to-action buttons. Feature cards communicate the main benefits of MealMate, while testimonials help establish trust. A final CTA encourages users to begin their meal-planning journey. The layout was adapted for both desktop and mobile screens to maintain usability and consistency across devices.)
/E (13. Design Rationale . > The MealMate landing page was designed with a clean and health-focused visual style to communicate the purpose of the application quickly. Green was chosen as the primary color to represent health, freshness, and natural food. The hero section provides a clear introduction and prominent call-to-action buttons. Feature cards communicate the main benefits of MealMate, while testimonials help establish trust. A final CTA encourages users to begin their meal-planning journey. The layout was adapted for both desktop and mobile screens to maintain usability and consistency across devices.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
